  "project_description": "This module provides site builders with additional options for the 'summary' field when using \"Text Area with a Summary\" widget.\n\n Often, a summary or teaser field is used when displaying content in views. Drupal already has built in support for a summary field, however there is not much control of whether or not it is display, or required.\n\n The four main options are:\n\n \n Show summary: Always show the summary field \n Summary help text: Customize the summary help text \n Summary Placeholder: Customize the summary placeholder \n Mark Summary as required: Only necessary with core <8.8. See: [#1704864] \n \n Related Modules \n \n Summary Settings",
